  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You died—or so you believed. When you awoke, you were no longer the same. Your mind survived, preserved physically or digitally as a perfect neuroprint, but your body is not your own: it has been replaced by an artificial shell built in the ghastly laboratories of Mordenheim Kinetics. You know what this experimental surgery costs, and it is a price you can't (or won't) pay. To build a new life—whatever \"life\" means now—you must escape the company to which you owe your strange existence.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Constitution, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.3lVV4sKAcFFbGCrD]{Symbiotic Being} or a Dark Gift feat of your choice</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Athletics and Medicine</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulSmithsTool]{Smith's Tools} (as welding tools)</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulSmithsTool]{Smith's Tools} (as welding tools), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLanternBull]{Bullseye Lantern} (as flashlight), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCaltrops000]{Caltrops}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagChain000000]{Chain}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCrowbar0000]{Crowbar}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagGrapplingHo]{Grappling Hook}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (3 flasks; as 3 flashlight batteries), 9 GP (as 9 dollars); or (B) 50 GP (as 50 dollars)</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
